1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,970
GALILEO: Am I finally believed?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,400
ANDRE: Believed, taught —
and turned into a simple story:

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,600
one man against the whole world.

4
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:15,200
The truth was harder,
and more interesting.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:22,800
GALILEO: And what survives of the question?

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,100
ANDRE: Your observations.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,800
And one lesson from your trial
that people keep relearning:

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,800
silencing a man does not settle a question.
